     6	
     7	In the paper's HAA table the oriented CylindricalViT (exp_06 arm C) is pretrained and fine-tuned with an explicit loudspeaker-facing cue while the vanilla xRIR baseline is not. Does CERPA's advantage persist when the SimpleViT baselines receive the same explicit cue, and does the explicit cue by itself change the SimpleViT baselines?
