   544	    """What each new arm must have started from: exp_01's weights, exp_06's approved
   545	    epoch, or -- for arm E -- exp_04's approved ``checkpoints.aug``.
   546	
   547	    E's identity is resolved through 6.4's ``reused`` exp_04 pin rather than a literal, so
   548	    only the approvals a reviewer committed can name it; the record it was read from is
   549	    bound into ``inputs`` and published with the analysis. It is resolved only when E is
   550	    among the arms being loaded, so an exp_06 run depends on nothing further.
   551	    """
