   601	    ``verify_child`` re-runs the child's own role validator, which rehashes the data
   602	    inventory (the HAA cache files it read), every file of its source closure and every
   603	    mutable input it recorded. Those bytes are what the certification rests on, so they
   604	    are retained here with the digests that validation confirmed -- publication
   605	    revalidates the whole map, and a second, different digest for any of these paths is
   606	    a contradiction rather than an update.
