codex
I found several concrete gaps that remain in the plan: the old fine-tuning loop is embedded in `main`, the summarizer needs per-arm finalizer dispatch as well as digest mapping, and some historical R1 rows lack the fields v2 promises to copy. The adapter is a valid supplementary control, but with one heading shared by all rooms it cannot isolate the value of heading information.
